Date: Fri, 7 Nov 2025 07:00:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add DuckDuckGo on all regional list of search engines

Commands used for appending and replacing regional list of search
engines in json, in order:

```bash
    sed -ri "N;N;s/,(|\n)?\n        \"\&duckduckgo\"//g;P;D" definitions/regional_settings.json

    sed -ri "s/\"search_engines\": \[/&\n        \"\&duckduckgo\",/g" definitions/regional_settings.json

```
